//! The tables H-43's round pinned from its runs, a row a line (ADR-0227).

use crate::*;

/// H-43's verdict, as read (ADR-0210): yes. On seeds 22, 23 and 24, in both of H-25's arms at a delay
/// of one trial and of two, every mapping was learned, 118 to 128 of its last 128 correct; no
/// coupling passed 1.30 of its image's, the highest 1.277; each reversal crossed in 9 to 16 blocks;
/// and the outside sum held.
pub(crate) const KEPT_1024: Option<Kept> = Some(Kept { clauses: [[[[true; 4]; 2]; 2]; 3], yes: true });

/// ADR-0207's three predicted readings, as read: the first and the third held, the second missed.
/// The address named the rewarded trial's pair in 0.948 to 0.964 of each arm's rewards, and each
/// mapping's last block's mean value was 0.836 to 0.985 of the reward. The reversals summed fewer
/// blocks at one trial's delay than on time on seed 23 from the mirrored assignment, 34 against
/// 37, and on seed 24 from the assignment, 35 against 37, and fewer at two than at one on seed 24
/// from the mirrored assignment, 41 against 42.
pub(crate) const KEPT_READINGS_READ_1024: Option<[Option<bool>; 3]> = Some([Some(true), Some(false), Some(true)]);

